openapi.info.description=Dashboard Management Service for API Management Console (AMC) Portal\n\n\
This service manages administrative dashboards and batch operations for APIs onboarded to the NGINX gateway, enabling efficient dashboard management and workflow automation.\n\n\
Key Features:\n\
* Create and manage administrative dashboards for API oversight\n\
* Enable efficient batch operations for API management workflows\n\
* Support API governance through JIRA integration and workflow automation\n\
* Facilitate organized dashboard operations for NGINX gateway management\n\n\
Available Endpoints:\n\
* POST /pinxt-selfservice/v1/dashboard - Create new dashboard\n\
* GET /pinxt-selfservice/v1/dashboard/{id} - Get dashboard by ID\n\
* PATCH /pinxt-selfservice/v1/dashboard/{id} - Update dashboard\n\
* DELETE /pinxt-selfservice/v1/dashboard/{id} - Delete dashboard\n\
* POST /pinxt-selfservice/v1/appDashboard - Create app dashboard\n\
* GET /pinxt-selfservice/v1/appDashboard/{dashboardId} - Get app dashboard by ID\n\
* PATCH /pinxt-selfservice/v1/appDashboard/{dashboardId} - Update app dashboard\n\
* GET /pinxt-selfservice/v1/appDashboard - Get app dashboards\n\
* POST /pinxt-selfservice/v1/batch-update - Start batch update\n\
* GET /pinxt-selfservice/v1/batch-update/{id} - Get batch update\n\
* GET /pinxt-selfservice/v1/batch-update/{id}/status - Get batch update status\n\n\
Authentication:\n\
* JWT authentication required (X-JWT header)\n\
* Administrative privileges required for dashboard management\n\
* Comprehensive security validation\n\n\
Use Cases:\n\
* API administrators can create and manage operational dashboards\n\
* Users can monitor API metrics and performance through dashboards\n\
* Administrators can execute batch operations for API lifecycle management\n\
* Support JIRA integration for workflow automation and tracking\n\n\
Note: This service is a critical administrative component of the API Management Portal, designed to enhance operational efficiency and provide comprehensive dashboard management capabilities.

