This service manages comprehensive API lifecycle operations for APIs onboarded to the NGINX gateway, enabling efficient API management and organization.\n\n\
Key Features:\n\
* Create and manage APIs with full lifecycle support\n\
* Enable efficient API discovery through comprehensive metadata management\n\
* Support API governance through structured version control and ratings\n\
* Facilitate organized API onboarding to NGINX gateway with client management\n\n\
Available Endpoints:\n\
* POST /apis - Create new API\n\
* GET /apis/{apiId} - Get API by ID\n\
* PATCH /apis/{apiId} - Update API\n\
* DELETE /internal-api/apis/{apiId} - Delete API\n\
* GET /apis - Get all APIs with filtering options\n\
* GET /apis/availabilityCheck - Check API availability\n\
* GET /apis/families/{apiFamilyId}/versions - Get API versions by family\n\
* GET /apis/{apiId}/clients - Get clients by API ID\n\
* GET /apis/{apiId}/rating - Get API rating\n\
* PUT /apis/{apiId}/rating - Create or update API rating\n\
* POST /apis/{apiId}/feedback - Create API feedback\n\
* GET /apis/{apiId}/feedback - Get API feedback\n\
* POST /apis/{apiId}/sdk - Create SDK for API\n\
* GET /gateway - Get all gateway information\n\
* GET /gateway/{gatewayId} - Get gateway by ID\n\
* GET /apis/opensearch - OpenSearch API discovery\n\
* POST /apis/internal-api/bulksync - Bulk sync APIs to OpenSearch\n\
* POST /apis/internal-api/bulksync/ondemand - On-demand bulk sync\n\
* POST /apis/version-locks - Create version locks\n\
* DELETE /apis/version-locks/{apiId} - Delete version locks\n\
* GET /app/validate - Validate CMDB application\n\n\
Authentication:\n\
* JWT authentication required (X-JWT header)\n\
* Administrative privileges required for API management operations\n\
* Comprehensive security validation\n\n\
Use Cases:\n\
* API teams can create and manage APIs during onboarding process\n\
* Users can search and discover APIs using comprehensive filtering\n\
* Administrators can manage API lifecycle and client access\n\
* Support API rating, feedback, and SDK generation workflows\n\n\
Note: This service is the core component of the API Management Portal, designed to provide comprehensive API lifecycle management and discovery capabilities.



